==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 5.33~15.33 seconds<sup>160f~460f</sup>.
*6 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10.67~18 seconds<sup>320f~540f</sup>.
*2 [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 8~16.67 seconds<sup>240f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

